# Frontend environment variables for NER Landslide Early Warning
# ==============================================================
# VITE_ADMIN_PASSCODE — passcode required to access the Admin Portal.
# Set this to your chosen passcode. The value is read client-side via
# import.meta.env.VITE_ADMIN_PASSCODE and compared against what the user
# enters. This is NOT real security — it is a simple gate for the demo.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL — optional: base URL for the FastAPI backend.
#   e.g. VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-render-url.onrender.com
# VITE_ENABLE_LIVE_DATA — optional: if set to "false", the app will use
#   simulated fallback data instead of attempting live API calls.
#   Default: "true"